---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = 'September 5, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure — Main Street Toolbox" description="How Main Street Toolbox handles affiliate relationships and why the calculators stay independent and ad-free." path="/affiliate-disclosure/">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-3);font-size:var(--fs-400)">Last updated {updated}</p>
    <h2>Current status: no affiliate links, no ads</h2>
    <p>As of today, Main Street Toolbox contains no advertising and no affiliate links. The calculators are free
    and independent, and no software company has paid for — or previewed — any recommendation on this site.</p>
    <h2>If that ever changes</h2>
    <p>If we later recommend business software and earn a commission for sign-ups, the recommendation will be
    clearly labelled as a partner recommendation at the point where it appears, and this page will describe the
    arrangement. Our commitments regardless of monetization:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Calculators stay free and ungated — recommendations never unlock features.</li>
      <li>Recommendations only ever appear when a tool's result indicates a real problem, never as decoration.</li>
      <li>We only recommend products with a free option worth using on its own merits.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Paid concierge setup</h2>
    <p>Our <a href="/services">concierge setup service</a> is a paid service we perform directly — it is not an
    affiliate relationship and involves no third party.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
